WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.350
Numbers less than zero live to the left of zero.

00:00:03.350 --> 00:00:04.460
Start at three.

00:00:04.460 --> 00:00:07.630
Take away five: five steps left.

00:00:07.630 --> 00:00:10.770
We pass zero and land on negative two.

00:00:10.770 --> 00:00:13.200
Three minus five equals negative two.

